# The journal-submission bundle is deliberately NOT published.
#
# submission/ carries three things that must not be public:
#   Cover_Letter_RESS.docx            names an earlier version submitted to and
#                                     withdrawn from IEEE L-CSS, and two further
#                                     manuscripts still under review at IEEE TSP
#                                     and SPL. That is correspondence between the
#                                     authors and an editor, and publishing it
#                                     could prejudice reviews still in progress.
#   README_BEFORE_UPLOAD.txt          working notes: a defect log, open items,
#                                     and unverified statements about the paper's
#                                     weak points, written for the authors.
#   declarations/credit_statement_    an INFERRED authorship allocation, not a
#     DRAFT.txt                       record of fact. It names a co-author.
#
# Everything under it is otherwise a byte-for-byte duplicate of the files in
# the repository root, so nothing needed to reproduce the paper is lost.
submission/

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# LaTeX build products. theory.pdf, sub.pdf and theory.bbl are tracked on
# purpose; the rest is regenerated by the recipe in README.md.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.spl
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.blg
*.bak
*.gold
